{"id":"501978","name":"栗子白菜瘦肉汤","author":"緣豆兒","authorId":"8471333","desc":"","cover":"images/501978/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"栗子肉","amount":"150克"},{"name":"奶白菜","amount":"3棵"},{"name":"猪瘦肉","amount":"250克"},{"name":"枸杞子","amount":"15克"}],"sub":[{"name":"生姜","amount":"2 片"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"材料很简单","img":"images/501978/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"瘦肉切块焯水待用","img":"images/501978/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"白菜洗净切开","img":"images/501978/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中加水约1500ml，放入瘦肉、栗子和姜片","img":"images/501978/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"烧开后撇去浮沫，转小火煲1小时","img":"images/501978/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"再加入枸杞和白菜煲20分钟","img":"images/501978/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"最后加盐调味即可。","img":"images/501978/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}